DESCRIPTION:From Tudor Queens to Pop Icons\, the SIX wives of Henry VIII 
 take the microphone to remix five hundred years of historical heartbreak 
 into a Euphoric Celebration of 21st century girl power! This new original
  musical is the global sensation that everyone is losing their head over!
   &#160\;The New York Times says SIX "TOTALLY RULES!" (Critic's Pick) and
  The Washington Post hails SIX as "Exactly the kind of energizing\, inspi
 rational illumination this town aches for!"  &#160\;  The SIX: LIVE ON OP
 ENING NIGHT Broadway album debuted at Number 1 on the Billboard cast albu
 m charts and surpassed one billion streams worldwide!
