 art\, and flawless harmonies. This year's performance will be part of the
 ir nationwide Making Spirits Bright Tour.</p><p>  &#160\;</p><p>  The nin
 e-man act\, including Walter Chase\, Jerome Collins\, Seggie Isho\, Micha
