SUMMARY:The Wiz
DESCRIPTION:The Tony Award-winning Best Musical that took the world by st
 orm is back.  &#160\;The Wiz returns "home" to stages across America in a
 n all-new tour\, direct from Broadway.  &#160\;The Baltimore Sun raves "P
 owerhouse performances. Stunning choreography. Visionary sets\," and the 
 Chicago Sun-Times proclaims The Wiz is "an eye-popping and high-intensity
  revival!"  &#160\;  This groundbreaking twist on The Wizard of Oz change
 d the face of Broadway—from its iconic score packed with soul\, gospel\
 , rock\, and 70s funk to its stirring tale of Dorothy's journey to find h
 er place in a contemporary world.  &#160\;  Everybody rejoice—this dyna
 mite infusion of ballet\, jazz\, and modern pop brings a whole new groove
  to easing on down the road!
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  The Tony Award-winning Best Musical tha
 t took the world by storm is back.</p><p>  &#160\;</p><p><i>The Wiz</i> r
 eturns "home" to stages across America in an all-new tour\, direct from B
 roadway.</p><p>  &#160\;</p><p><i>The Baltimore Sun</i> raves "Powerhouse
  performances. Stunning choreography. Visionary sets\," and the <i>Chicag
 o Sun-Times</i> proclaims <i>The Wiz</i> is "an eye-popping and high-inte
 nsity revival!"</p><p>  &#160\;</p><p>  This groundbreaking twist on <i>T
 he Wizard of Oz</i> changed the face of Broadway—from its iconic score 
 packed with soul\, gospel\, rock\, and 70s funk to its stirring tale of D
 orothy's journey to find her place in a contemporary world.</p><p>  &#160
 \;</p><p>  Everybody rejoice—this dynamite infusion of ballet\, jazz\, 
 and modern pop brings a whole new groove to easing on down the road!</p>
