 zy and Beau are getting hitched\, when the corn that protects their small
  community starts to die. The town needs answers. But who will dare ventu
 re beyond the borders of Cob County?</p><p>  &#160\;</p><p>  Including th
 e knockout songs "Woman of the World\," "Somebody Will\," and "Independen
 tly Owned\," this Broadway hit about an unlikely hero\, an unscrupulous c
 on artist\, and a battle for the heart and soil of a small town\, is not 
 to be missed.</p>
